```python3
first_link = page.get_by_role("article", name="Willy Wonka").get_by_role("link", name="Share")
```
</example>

Here is another example:
<example>
article {{
    header "How can I install CUDA on Ubuntu 22?";
    link "Share";
}};

article {{
    header "How do I install Docker?";
    link "Share";
}};


